            "detailed_description": "It is a story-driven rpg-adventure where guns and magic act together! <br />\r\nBecome a member of this powerful Order whose mission it is to protect Earth. Travel through other worlds, contend with monsters, upgrade your weapons and enhance your magic. Have fun!<br />\r\n <br />\r\n• Match 3 battles with a lot of features<br />\r\n• Multiple strange new worlds to explore<br />\r\n• Hordes of enemies to fight<br />\r\n• Tons of different weapons, items, and spells!<br />\r\n• Awesome graphics!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Awards<br />\r\n★ DevGAMM Award <br />\r\n★ MS Windows Store Staff Pick",
